<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-NICHIREI WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NICHIREI WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>Nichirei international women's tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) beat Yuka Yoshida (Japan) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>5-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6) 6-2</p>
<p>1-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Mana Endo (Japan) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>3-Kimiko Date (Japan) beat Nana Miyagi (Japan) 4-6 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
